# Cycle Setup — persistent environment facts

> Always in context: this file is imported via `@SETUP.md` in CLAUDE.md, so it
> survives `/compact` and is re-injected every turn. Keep it current.
> Edit this file directly; `/cortex:handoff` also sweeps new facts into it.
> Last updated: {{TS}}

These are the setup/environment facts that hold for the **whole cycle** — the
things you must NOT forget after a compact. Fill in only what applies; leave the
rest as `(not set)`. Never store secrets here (tokens, passwords, keys).

