| terraform dir / workspace | (not set) | |
| Other tool profiles | (not set) | |

## Operational invariants / notes

_(free-form: "always use X", "never touch Y", discovered constraints that must
hold for the rest of the cycle)_

A long-lived local environment started for this cycle (compose stack, dev server,
tunnel) gets a row in a `## Local environment` section added to this file; `/cortex:end`
tears it down at close. Row format: `skills/end/SKILL.md` § "Local environment record".
